OL,3,GNEWSALASK to hold silence for Celtic
OL,4,Afan who died during Champions League
OL,5,Amatch
OL,6,
OL,7,FAustrian champions LASK will hold a
OL,8,Fsilence in memory of a Celtic supporter
OL,9,Fwho died when the sides met in Glasgow
OL,10,Flast week.
OL,12,FThe 65-year-old fan took ill in the
OL,13,Fstadium during the first leg of the
OL,14,FChampions League play-off at Celtic
OL,15,FPark on Wednesday.
OL,17,FHe was taken to Glasgow Royal Infirmary
OL,18,Fbut died a short time later.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,427,420,260,160,0,100
